{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你猜我撑了多久？我猜到一半，才看见你伸了手。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.698, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "够不够？我猜你猜的是这局，我猜的是你刚才那一下。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.794, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 233, "total_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第二句破音？那才怪，我刚才把音调调得比平时还轻。别夸，我刚才把音调调得比平时还轻。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.917, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 61, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 226, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "第二句破音？那才怪，我刚才把音调调得比平时还轻。别夸，我刚才把音调调得比平时还轻。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.939, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 55, "prompt_tokens": 249, "total_tokens": 304, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "木勺给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。别急，等我把木勺递给你。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.628, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 163, "total_tokens": 204, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "木勺给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。别急，等我把木勺递给你。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.736, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 237, "total_tokens": 278, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台要管柜台，我负责送包裹。柜员和快递员得分工清楚。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.623, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 207, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "柜台先处理，云打雷了再送。柜员先处理，云打雷了再送。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.795, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 238, "total_tokens": 282, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你才喊左转，我还没看到路。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.672, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "你才喊左转，我还没看到路。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.741, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 233, "total_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "老板说，我昨天加班到凌晨，现在才敢说，今天上班，我就说，我昨天加班到凌晨，现在才敢说，今天上班，我就说，我昨天加班到凌晨，现在才敢说，今天上班，我就说，我昨天加班到凌晨。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.183, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 81, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 251, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "老板说，我昨天加班到凌晨，现在才敢说，今天上班，我就说，我昨天加班到凌晨，现在才敢说，今天上班，我就说，我昨天加班到凌晨。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.06, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 62, "prompt_tokens": 273, "total_tokens": 335, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁也没注意？那扣子就是没注意到。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.521, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 197, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "扣子太小，给个名字。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.558, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 29, "prompt_tokens": 227, "total_tokens": 256, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别累啦，我在这儿陪你解说。你还有什么想聊的吗？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.593, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 200, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "坐着看？行，我在这儿给你解说。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.471, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 18, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 247, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
